smstools-http-api (2.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Webhooks for smsd events: smstools-http-api-event (smsd eventhandler)
    queues RECEIVED/SENT/FAILED/REPORT/CALL events, the new
    smstools-http-api-webhooks service delivers them with retries
    (WEBHOOKS in settings.py; custom payload, e.g. Zabbix history.push).

